[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Thank You, Doctor.]
[00:00.88]Lesson 63 | 第63课
[00:03.06]Thank you, doctor. | 谢谢您，医生。
[00:05.81]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:12.05]Who else is in bed today? Why? | 今天还有谁躺在床上？为什么？
[00:18.16]How's Jimmy today? | 吉米今天怎么样了？
[00:21.30]Better. | 好多了。
[00:22.52]Thank you, doctor. | 谢谢您，医生。
[00:24.58]Can I see him please, Mrs. Williams? | 我能看看他吗，威廉斯夫人？
[00:28.75]Certainly, doctor. | 当然可以，医生。
[00:31.14]Come upstairs. | 上楼来吧。
[00:33.53]You look very well, Jimmy. | 你看上去很好，吉米。
[00:36.73]You are better now, but you mustn't get up yet. | 你现在好些了，但是还不能起床。
[00:42.04]You must stay in bed for another two days. | 你必须再卧床两天。
[00:47.56]The boy mustn't go to school yet, Mrs. Williams. | 这孩子还不能去上学，威廉斯夫人。
[00:52.88]And he mustn't eat rich food. | 他也不能吃油腻的食物。
[00:57.12]Does he have a temperature, doctor? | 他发烧吗，医生？
[01:01.75]No, he doesn't. | 不，他没有。
[01:03.88]Must he stay in bed? | 他必须卧床吗？
[01:06.78]Yes. He must remain in bed for another two days. | 是的。他必须再卧床两天。
[01:12.46]He can get up for about two hours each day, but you must keep the room warm. | 他每天可以起床大约两小时，但是你必须保持房间温暖。
[01:22.43]Where's Mr. Williams this evening? | 威廉斯先生今晚在哪儿？
[01:26.99]He's in bed, doctor. | 他在床上，医生。
[01:30.22]Can you see him please? | 您能去看看他吗？
[01:32.90]He has a bad cold, too! | 他也得了重感冒！